      "oa:hasSelector": [
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(3) The approved Minimum Equipment List must—\n\n(i) Be prepared in accordance with the limitations specified in paragraph (b) of this section; and\n\n(ii) Provide for the operation of the aircraft with the instruments and equipment in an inoperable condition."
